    "innovation": "This review paper synthesizes research on shallow cumulus cloud feedbacks, attributing the large diversity in climate model responses to fundamental differences between how parameterized global models and high-resolution models represent the sensitivity of cloudiness near the cloud-base to environmental changes.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
